---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="hero container prose">
    <h1>About this project</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A free, open-source Kubernetes and DevOps practice lab — built in public as part of
      <a href="https://github.com/Jacob-Idolor/Pet_Projects">Pet Projects</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Philosophy</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Local-first</strong> — real clusters on your laptop, not expensive shared sandboxes</li>
      <li><strong>Deployable mindset</strong> — every skill ties to production patterns</li>
      <li><strong>Open</strong> — fork it, host your own copy, contribute labs and fixes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Fork & host your own</h2>
    <p>
      The static site deploys to S3 + CloudFront for roughly <strong>$1–5/month</strong>.
      See the <a href="https://github.com/Jacob-Idolor/Pet_Projects/tree/main/kubernetes/infra">infra folder</a>
      for Terraform with cost safeguards (no EKS/EC2).
    </p>

    <h2>Contribute</h2>
    <p>
      Issues and PRs welcome — new labs, typo fixes, better break/fix scenarios.
      See <a href="https://github.com/Jacob-Idolor/Pet_Projects/blob/main/kubernetes/CONTRIBUTING.md">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
